# Representative fixture for terminal (bat/syntect) syntax highlighting.
# Implicit Action lines (e.g. Select plan) stay ordinary text by design.

Flow Premium onboarding
Id premium.onboarding

# Structural Screen with nested Layout and Section
  Screen Premium paywall
  Id premium.paywall

    Layout
      Sidebar | Content | Inspector

      Rules
        Sidebar can be collapsed

      When the user enters the mobile breakpoint
        Layout
          Sidebar
          Content
          Inspector

    Section Sidebar
      Shows
        Plan options

    Section Content
      Shows
        Plan comparison

    Section Inspector
      Shows
        Plan details

    # Explicit Action
    Action Open checkout
    Id premium.open-checkout
      Receives
        Selected plan
      Steps
        Prepare checkout session
        Once checkout is ready
          Go to premium.checkout
        At the same time
          Log plan selection
          Notify analytics
        If payment fails
          Shows
            Retry payment
      Outcome
        Checkout is available

    # Implicit Action — name line intentionally unhighlighted
    Select plan
      Rules
        Plan must be Yearly or Monthly
      If the plan requires a trial
        Shows
          Trial banner
      Otherwise
        Go to premium.paywall

  Screen Checkout
  Id premium.checkout
    Shows
      Payment form

  # Mid-line prose must not highlight as directives
  Action Prose sample
  Id samples.prose
    Rules
      Only show this when product results are available
      Do not run if the user is anonymous
      Follow the rules in the brand guide
      Wait no longer than 10 minutes
      Greeting with "welcome" and the user's name
